```mermaid
flowchart TD
    R[One row<br/>time-point record]
    S[One sample<br/>one full action]
    W[One segment<br/>several samples regrouped]
    Q1[What happened now?]
    Q2[Was this action unusual?]
    Q3[Has the recent state shifted?]

    R --> S --> W
    R -.answers.-> Q1
    S -.answers.-> Q2
    W -.answers.-> Q3
```
